						 <p>First of all, I known that the dish is quite controversial, but I can guarantee that I've no ulterior motive or whatever, I'm just curious.</p> <p>What is SPC stance toward shark fin soup? An effective method to keep selachian population in check but sadly unacceptable because it doesn't involve punching them in face, or it's just unacceptable because it kill selachian without punching them in face? On the other hand, can pugilists enjoy the dish if it's confirmed that the selachian is already punched before they cut its fins?</p> 
				 	]]>
