					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10398375#post-4163451</guid>
				<title>FISTS AT THE READY</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10398375/spc-hub#post-4163451</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 24 Feb 2019 04:18:25 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>PeppersGhost</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1553042</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It may not be the hub we need, but it's the hub we deserve. Or maybe the opposite? Eh.</p> <p>In absence of a perfect medium, at least we now have an SPC hub page. Which is more than what we had, which was not a hub page, so net gain overall.</p> <p>For a hub page that's properly hub-page-y, please see the link to MrWrong's sandbox at the bottom of the hub page. Like Schubert's Symphony No. 8 in B minor, it is sadly unfinished, but it explains the SPC GOI format and the overall Centreverse in better terms than I could muster. Any attempt at such would basically end up being a cheap paraphrase of MrWrong's, so you might as well have it directly from the source!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
